ng Beach is active**. We can leave it in the registry as **UNCONFIRMED / PAUSED** and only resolve it if another Wave 4 source gives stronger context or you explicitly reopen the idea.\n\nSend the next Wave 4 item.", "text_chars": 2459, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "5f4e0159-3822-4d4e-ad6e-02c8760d9f95", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790207053.7896478, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "model_editable_context", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "3ee86996-a92a-4849-ab58-09d2a205b288", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790207055.385813, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "e4843b5d-fd45-4021-8af5-1c12fe179079", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790226742.077, "updated_at": 1790226771.112424, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "You give Don the identity in Frozen canonical. GCE stack. Hierarchy. With roles, identity, etc. ", "text_chars": 96, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "5e